ind":"announcement","title":"New Legends Entering Sheeple.","summary":"Hello there, Sheeple!As the studio grew over the years, Sheeple was developed, and we now have the capacity to create unique characters, dialogue, and lore for our games! (Without it being just a blob of text)Today I will show you our new characters!Atofe - The Crimson SaintessValentina - Conjurer of VenomLambert - The Grand ArtificerPetter - The Supposedly rightful heirEach and every Legend is bring a different play style, having different units available to their use and unique cards. They wil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T20:25:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692633","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1846651706688771","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Sheeple is BACK! 1.3","summary":"Hello there, Sheeple!After a long time, we are back in development. With new experience and skills, I can guarantee you that Sheeple will be far better than advertised. Today I'm here to tell you about the changes Sheeple went through between versions 1.0 and 1.3. I also bring a new Steam Capsule and a New Trailer!Change Log A new loading system is put in place, now the maps are generated when you try to enter them, not when you open campaignReworked in-battle UI.Added an animated intro for the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T04:10:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688771","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1818118366172817","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Go Kill Clankers in Clankers!","summary":"Hello there, Sheeple!We've just released a new Incremental game about killing robots called Clankers!Please play and review it!Have a successful day!Leon.D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-04T12:34:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818118366172817","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1810503566449415","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Bubbler is Out!","summary":"Hello there, Sheeple!We released a new game called Bubbler!It's a farming game where you plant and grow bubbles. Please check it out!BubblerHave a fruitful day!Leon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-09-12T12:48:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1810503566449415","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1805065414257262","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Sheeple 1.0","summary":"Hello there, Sheeple!It's Leon Here, today I'm here to spotlight for you guys a 1.0 update for Sheeple. It is an absolute ton of fixes so brace yourselves!Sheeple now has Audio Settings! Yes now you can actually turn off all the audio in the game without using outside options. The army system had been overhauled. New units and new cards are in the game as well as a multiplayer system which is locked from the Demo had been added. Also the game is now available in 37 languages!Change LogDead Units","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-07-12T03:49:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1805065414257262","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1803527891608114","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Sheeple 1.0f28","summary":"Hello there, Sheeple,Due to some confusion in the loading screen, I've moved the lore scenes behind the loading screen so you will no longer see such images before loading finishes:Have a memorable day,Leon :D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-29T13:53:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1803527891608114","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1803527891573906","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Sheeple Demo Is Avaliable for FREE!","summary":"Hello there Sheeple!From today on Sheeple will have its Demo version avaliable for free!GO, play it, review it, and have fun with it, right now!Have a prosperous dayLeon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-28T12:01:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1803527891573906","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1801617199500295","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Wrath of Wraiths","summary":"Hello there, Sheeple!This is the last time you see 0.7 on the version screenThis update contains a ton of new content, which includes both units and Cards! Additionally, performance had been greatly improved, and additional polish was put in place. During the last week, I was mostly focused on preparing the architecture for the big features, which you'll see next week, so be ready!Change List: Colossus UnitDeleted the detector LightMilitia UnitFixed PathfindingAdded coloured flags which mark the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-08T20:08:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1801617199500295","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1799817379587505","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Stream","summary":"Hello there. Sheeple! Today we will persume a live brodcast of Sheeple playtesting! Cheers! :D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-19T06:38:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1799817379587505","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1799088287805348","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Sheeple joins Indie Assembly","summary":"Hello there, Sheeple! Sheeple just joined Indie Assembly, now we and 1205 other games unite together in Indie suffering... Indie freedom and happiness haha! See other games in the Indie Assembly and wishlist Sheeple if you haven't done that yet! Big thank you to Excalliber for accepting Sheeple into Indie Assemble! Leon Ill-Fated Studios","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-07T16:58:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1799088287805348","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1797185861796499","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Sheeple Shops","summary":"Hello There, Sheeple! In Sheeple, there is a Shop system that allows players to buy new units! There are 3 different shopkeepers, each with a different fraction of units they can sell. Each time you finish a battle, the amount of shopkeepers in the shop space is being randomised as well as: the shopkeepers themself, the units they are selling, and the terrain in the shop. To buy units in the shop, you need to have sheep which are later sacrificed to the shopkeepers as payment. To gain sheep, you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-04-22T11:27:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1797185861796499","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1794830911013126","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Nordic Game Jam 2025","summary":"Hello there, Sheeple! This year I will be attending Nordic Game Jam 2025 In Denmark! If any of you are interested in meeting me and talking about how great Sheeple is or pointing out a fatal flaw you see in it, then please come see me! I will also be walking with the newest version of Sheeple so stay tuned for that! Sheeple might be showcasing on NGJ but that will strongly depend on how they are with space, In well worst case I will just conquer a random table for us, muahaha! New Screen Shot of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-24T22:14:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794830911013126","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1794102528218868","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Loading Screens","summary":"Hello There Sheeple! Lately, on DevGamm Gdańsk Game Roast it was pointed out that the game's loading is absurdly high, the entire 7 minutes! That is why I've worked on it and the average loading time has been reduced to 1 minute. I've also added 3 new loading screen versions for a total of 4 so that the screen itself isn't overly boring and doesn't become a target of annoyance (it will I'm just postponing it) here are the Loading Screens: Cursed Heaven: {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45341705/51867fa0dbda3a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-18T00:02:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1794102528218868","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1793384379509165","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Sheeple Release Date","summary":"Hello there, Sheeple! Sheeple was originally planned to be released in September. Still, because I would like to take additional time testing & polishing the game when it is in its Demo version, I've decided to delay the release up to November. The precise date of the game's release will be announced later when I work out the details. To celebrate the change of the release date into one more set in stone, I present before you a new Sheeple Battle Trailer! Have a fruitful day! Leon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-10T18:33:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1793384379509165","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1793384379350440","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Map Types","summary":"Hello there, Sheeple! It's Leon here, lately, I've been mostly working on exploiting Sheeple's procedural generation system and adding new biomes. The biomes I've currently added to Sheeple: Blood Forest {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45341705/013c51dbefa85bb703e9b5de1cbe9b358560ed1c.png Swamp {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45341705/05595f9d4b5a5cc38c558d0a016594d4bfc01a01.png City map {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45341705/ead7f2280205e6d0cc874660ff15c1e8cbf75fae.png {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45341705/6e037e901d2d8fd17cdc9fbd2a45aadba3","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-05T20:36:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1793384379350440","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1792116353257544","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"Attending DevGaam Gdańsk","summary":"Hello there, Sheeple! It's Leon here, in the next week I'll be attending DevGaam in Gdańsk. I'll also be presenting Sheeple in the game roast so it will be possible to see me protecting it from the roast :D If you have any thoughts on Sheeple, don't be shy—come up to meet me. I'm highly extroverted, so social interactions are always fun. Have a prosperous day! Leon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-02-22T11:33:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1792116353257544","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2921480-1786573930976750","game_id":"steam-2921480","kind":"announcement","title":"New Year Wishes","summary":"Hello there, Sheeple! It’s Leon here, I just wanted to wish you all a Merry Christmas and a Happy New Year! As of now I’m mostly focused on Sheeple but do not fret Idiots’ Fantasy and Rune It Out both have their new updates nearly ready. They should be out before February, as of Sheeple I’m as of now focusing on the Overworld part and readying up the game for the Demo which’s release date I'm going to announce soon. As I’m writing this I’m thinking of a resolution for the new year that will help","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-12-30T16:47:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1786573930976750","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2921480":{"last_at